# Normalise text to LF in the repository, regardless of the OS that wrote it.
# Without this, edits made on Windows silently rewrite whole files as CRLF and every diff looks like
# a total rewrite, which hides the real change, makes review impossible, and lets one person's work
# be reverted without anyone seeing it. That is PL-042 in PAB-Memory:problem-log.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary / generated — never touch
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
